Maintainer: xCAT <xcat-user@lists.sourceforge.net>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 12)
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Homepage: https://ipxe.org/

Package: ipxe-xcat
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: iPXE network boot binaries from the upstream release
 The ipxeboot.tar.gz tree of the iPXE 2.0.0 release, installed unchanged
 under /tftpboot/xcat/ipxe. It carries the signed Secure Boot builds and
 their shim. The source archive of the release tag is installed with the
 documentation.
